      "statement": "A blueprint captures source code (committed snapshot stripped of edit history), binding requirements (shape only — no credentials or live connections), and metadata, but deliberately not SQLite storage, chat history, or edit history; the code content is a gzip-compressed Yjs V2 state snapshot stored in R2 at <blueprintId>/<version> with old versions retained against instantiation races.",
