      "id": "claim_43433b58aacf405692200026ba64ea55",
      "statement": "Bundled format blueprints ship as <name>.gadget plus a <name>.json sidecar whose curated values the installer writes over the archive's own; they use stable readable ids (format.document) because install and promotion are keyed on them, have no owning User DO (written straight into the featured mirror), and each is promoted into AdminConfig.formats exactly once ever — an upgrade never undoes an admin's later removal; installation is triggered by the first /api request and stamped only when the whole manifest is live.",
